abstract: >-
  Operational-formal working paper about canonical past and future archives in
  QIK-VRT Effect Acknowledgement. The accompanying Lean source specifies finite
  conformance properties and requires a separate exact-head kernel receipt in
  the proof-bearing publication bundle. Ontic retrocausality and panpsychism
  remain separately open or interpretative.
